`category` `block-prose` · eHTML `<note-list>` · JATS `<fn-group>` · `content` `empty` → `<children>`

| attribute | kind | values / default | notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| `type` | kwarg | `end-notes` `chapter-notes` `footnotes-collected` `other` (default `end-notes`) |  |

