<section #eh-summary | `<summary>`>

<sub-section | Specification>

`category` `block-prose` · eHTML `<summary>` · JATS `<(no direct JATS counterpart; HTML-native)>` · `content` `prose` → `<children>`

*No kwargs or boolean flags.*

Produced by: canonical `<summary>`.

<sub-section | Examples>

<code #code:eh-summary-1>
<summary | More background>
</code>

<minipage #mp:eh-summary-1>
<summary | More background>
</minipage>

*The visible heading of a &lt;details&gt; disclosure. Appears as a
child of &lt;details&gt;.*

<code #code:eh-summary-2>
<summary | Click to reveal the <em | hidden> details>
</code>

<minipage #mp:eh-summary-2>
<summary | Click to reveal the <em | hidden> details>
</minipage>

*Inline markup in a summary. The recursive-content pass parses
the pipe content normally.*
